#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "A clean, fast theme for tour operators, destination management companies and travel agencies. Pages are built with the WordPress block editor; colours, type and spacing come from theme.json, so the editor and the site always match. No page builder, no jQuery on the front end, right-to-left ready. Works on its own and pairs with the iTourTMS plugins for tours, transfers, hotels and bookings."
